2. Stock Amix context in src/kernel-patches/*.patch -- NOT MIT
---------------------------------------------------------------

Files: src/kernel-patches/support.c.patch, scsi.c.patch, a3091.c.patch,
       a2091.c.patch

Each patch carries, besides the author's added lines, the minimal verbatim
stock text a unified diff needs in order to apply: 135 unchanged context
lines plus the 25 stock lines the patches replace ("-" lines), 160 lines in
all, taken from amiga/kernel/support.c, amiga/alien/scsi.c,
amiga/alien/a3091.c and amiga/alien/a2091.c.

Provenance: Commodore Amiga UNIX (Amix) System V Release 4, version 2.1 --
